{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/33d22d3b7451336acea96995937359f5.poster.avif?t=1772108389\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/33d22d3b7451336acea96995937359f5.webm?t=1772108389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/33d22d3b7451336acea96995937359f5.mp4?t=1772108389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>project; VIRAI: DOOMER\u2019s LIFE ESCAPE</strong> is a horror-RPG with elements of visual novel and psychological thriller, where you live the life of Hicha \u2014 a shut-in hikikomori girl trapped in an endless depressive routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/78fcce01ace45b72425bc4d68407176b.poster.avif?t=1772108389\" width=222 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/78fcce01ace45b72425bc4d68407176b.webm?t=1772108389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/78fcce01ace45b72425bc4d68407176b.mp4?t=1772108389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that gives her life meaning is Virai \u2014 her virtual alter ego and a singer in the global social network VITA. Will you be able to make Virai popular and save Hicha, or will the depressive reality finally consume her? What is really hiding inside the perfect-looking world of VITA?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/2ed43f4520f14ef48b947380d775a931.avif?t=1772108389\" width=400 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features<strong>:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hicha\u2019s life simulator</strong> \u2014 live her days: suffer, worry, ruin your health, and sink into the endless loop of routine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the emotional world of the protagonist</strong> through multiple visual styles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the perfect life in VITA,</strong> a flawless virtual reality that offers a way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/bb1d1c730edc403e2b4862ea8cef5e07.avif?t=1772108389\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the secrets of Virai\u2019s world</strong> in an ARG-style quest \u2014 of course we have one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock 10 different endings,</strong> ranging from total collapse to salvation. The ending is up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy an original soundtrack</strong> composed specifically for the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 music tracks</strong> from russian doomer music and post-punk artists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique visual style and artwork</strong> by artist RIKANI (<i>\u201c</i>An alt girl for skoof<i>\u201d</i>).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Hicha escape her routine and find happiness? It\u2019s all in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/7ac01cc8fb75b151d45482eb749fff43.avif?t=1772108389\" width=440 height=222 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434180?t=1772108389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/e6c120798b3582d9383edc4beab28f0e42fa4a56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772108389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/1eeeb26ec3986750f01c975957f3c57be9139934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772108389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/1eeeb26ec3986750f01c975957f3c57be9139934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772108389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game has a dark and gloomy atmosphere and is a psychological thriller"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3537090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/33d22d3b7451336acea96995937359f5.poster.avif?t=1772108389\" width=400 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/33d22d3b7451336acea96995937359f5.webm?t=1772108389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434180/extras/33d22d3b7451336acea96995937359f5.mp4?t=1772108389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>project; VIRAI: DOOMER\u2019s LIFE ESCAPE</strong> is a horror-RPG with elements of visual novel and psychological thriller, where you live the life of Hicha \u201